safix::sandbox_unavailable

  × bwrap is not available, so no generator ran.
  │ 
  │ A generator's script and its validation fragments run inside a sandbox:
  │ the staging root is the only writable path, the nix store is read-only,
  │ and there is no network.
  │ 
  │ safix resolves it out of nixpkgs at spawn time, the way it resolves a
  │ generator's runtimeInputs, so this is not a package to install: it is a
  │ machine that will not run it. An unprivileged user namespace being
  │ disabled is what that usually is.
  │ 
  │ There is no flag that runs a generator outside the envelope.
